{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "cortico-world-ritual-alont1",
  "version": "0.1.4",
  "describe": {
    "tools": [
      {
        "name": "ritual_set",
        "description": "记下一个纪念日：月-日 + 名字。到那天她会主动提一句。",
        "parameters": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "date": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "月-日，如 10-01"
            },
            "name": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "这天是什么日子"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "date",
            "name"
          ]
        },
        "tags": [
          "write"
        ],
        "summary": {
          "zh": "记一个纪念日。",
          "en": "Records an anniversary."
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "ritual_list",
        "description": "列出记下的纪念日。",
        "parameters": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {}
        },
        "tags": [
          "read"
        ],
        "summary": {
          "zh": "列出纪念日。",
          "en": "Lists anniversaries."
        }
      }
    ],
    "events": [
      {
        "type": "ritual.morning",
        "description": {
          "zh": "到早上了。",
          "en": "Morning has come."
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "ritual.night",
        "description": {
          "zh": "到晚上了。",
          "en": "Night has come."
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "ritual.anniversary",
        "description": {
          "zh": "已登记纪念日到期；名称原文按 external 外部资料投递。",
          "en": "A recorded anniversary is due; its original name is external source material."
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "changelog": {
    "0.1.4": "- 早间提醒与纪念日分别去重；验证真实日期、失败重试与停止边界。\n- 固定早晚通知保持 internal；纪念日登记名称按 external 外部资料投递。\n- 面板保留快速交替启停的最终停止，显示执行中调用与耗时，按 failed:true 统计失败；面板代码随包内置。\n- 按 Cortico 0.2.7 的 World API 6 / Bot API 7 检查适用契约；单包产物不引入其他扩展。"
  }
}
